DESCRIPTION:MCCSC's January Parent University event\, How to Help Your Child with Homework\, will take place virtually via Zoom on Wednesday\, January 21\, 2026\, from 6-7pm.  Attendees will learn about strategies they can use effectively to help their child(ren) with homework\, and what to do when their child might not want help but needs it.  See attachment below for Zoom registration link. - https://www.mccsc.eduhttps://mccsc.zoom.us/meeting/register/wAEkY3sLQNSEWqcvLCSdmA#/registration
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T055655Z
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Parent University: How to Help with Homework at Home
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
